  "Solution": {
    "S": "Fittig reaction involves the coupling of two aryl halides in the presence of sodium metal in dry ether to form a biaryl compound.\n\nAmong the given options, option B shows 2C₆H₅Cl + 2Na → (C₆H₅)₂ + 2NaCl, which is the Fittig reaction.\n\nHence, the correct option is B."
  },
